               "text": "<p><hr /></p><p>Teaching goes beyond simply presenting information for memorization, as shown by a survey with teachers and students that validates the need for homework as a way to reinforce knowledge (<htcite0>).</p><p>In this section, the same games and applications available in Mathematical Games are offered in a printable version, so they can be played on a board.</p><p><b>The games can be updated at any time. <span id=\"family_common_sn\"></span></b></p>",
